license: MIT
keywords:
  - rocket propulsion
  - thermochemical equilibrium
  - nozzle flow
  - combustion
  - aerospace engineering
abstract: >-
  EnSim is an open-source desktop application and Python package for
  thermochemical equilibrium, ideal rocket-nozzle performance, preliminary
  cooling analysis, uncertainty propagation and six-degree-of-freedom flight
  simulation.
